menu "Reliability protocol test faults"

    config RELIABILITY_TEST_FAULTS
        bool "Enable TEST_FAULT command (test builds only)"
        default n
        help
            Enables the TEST_FAULT (0x7F) request handler so the host CLI can
            inject a bounded fault: 1 = uart task stops servicing (simulated
            hang), 2 = TX stepping pauses while RX parsing continues.
            Keep disabled in normal builds: normal builds answer UNSUPPORTED
            and never fault on their own.

endmenu
